@startuml C1_VVE_Update_Process
title C1 – VVE Update (High-Level Process)

start
:Operator opens VVE in progress;
:SPA preloads planned berth/dock details;
:Operator adjusts actual berth time & dock;
:SPA validates inputs and sends PATCH to TodoApi;
:TodoApi verifies identity and forwards to OEM;
:OEM service updates VVE, compares docks, appends warning if different;
:OEM logs update timestamp/user and emits audit event;
:OEM returns updated VVE DTO;
:TodoApi relays response to SPA;
:SPA displays confirmation and any warnings;
stop

@enduml
